1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,780
These old hands can't haul the load they hauled back then

2
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:06,900
So I picked up a pen, and I went to war again

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:10,340
My body's got a fence line, but my mind's got none

4
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:13,540
It's still out on the back roads chasing down the sun

5
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:16,580
Lot of folks see odds like that and fold before the turn

6
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:19,620
But I've seen what one match can do with enough room to burn

7
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:22,820
I quit fighting the weather, quit cussing the rain

8
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:26,260
Started working the one little field I could claim

9
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,540
You don't gotta walk on water to get to the other side

10
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:35,620
Just a little stubborn faith and a fire inside

11
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:38,900
When pushing forward is the only road left

12
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,940
You find the power in the very next breath

13
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:44,820
That's when courage meets the monster within

14
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:48,180
When the odds are stacked and they say you can't win

15
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:51,300
They say you're done, but watch the underdog run

16
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:54,340
Straight through the fire and into the sun

17
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:55,860
It's a quiet fire

18
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:57,300
Burning in the dark

19
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:59,700
No one sees the flame

20
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:02,660
But everybody feels the spark
